WEBVTT

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:10.875
The five Buddhist sealing
shrines have been destroyed.

00:00:10.875 --> 00:00:14.292
After which, the seals under
Kisaragi protection were breached.

00:00:14.292 --> 00:00:19.500
The Eight-Hands-Breadth Sword was released
and stolen by the Demoniacal Horde.

00:00:20.708 --> 00:00:23.000
And the vessel of the Golden Dragon?

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.208
He was there and was in contact.

00:00:26.208 --> 00:00:27.875
I see.

00:00:33.458 --> 00:00:36.667
The stars of fate are on the move then?

00:00:43.792 --> 00:00:45.917
<i>Time to die!</i>

00:00:48.125 --> 00:00:51.000
<i>The perfect world!</i>

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:58.417
<i>Tsukiakari no shita de...</i>

00:00:58.417 --> 00:01:01.125
<i>Let's break the spine!</i>

00:01:01.125 --> 00:01:05.958
<i>...yakusoku wo kawashita</i>

00:01:05.958 --> 00:01:10.875
<i>Gozen reiji hoeru you ni sasayaite</i>

00:01:10.875 --> 00:01:16.292
<i>Chinmoku to zattou no naka</i>

00:01:16.292 --> 00:01:21.458
<i>Kuruisou de kowaresou na genjou kai</i>

00:01:21.458 --> 00:01:25.375
<i>Kimi wa sou sa kimi no mama ikite</i>

00:01:25.375 --> 00:01:29.292
<i>That perfect world!</i>

00:01:29.292 --> 00:01:34.458
<i>Kamereon janakute</i>

00:01:34.458 --> 00:01:39.625
<i>Kokoro kara kawarou</i>

00:01:39.625 --> 00:01:43.292
<i>Kikoeru yo sono kotoba</i>

00:01:43.292 --> 00:01:49.833
<i>Subete no yoru ga akeru you ni sakebou</i>

00:01:49.833 --> 00:01:53.542
<i>Hageshisa to yasashisa de</i>

00:01:53.542 --> 00:02:05.125
<i>Subete no yoru ga sakeru you ni sakebou</i>

00:02:21.875 --> 00:02:25.125
This isn't it, this won't do.

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.083
This arm...

00:03:19.958 --> 00:03:21.333
Stay back.

00:03:27.833 --> 00:03:28.792
"Dark Arts Chapter"

00:03:28.792 --> 00:03:30.125
"Dark Arts Chapter"
"Eighth Night"

00:03:30.625 --> 00:03:32.125
"The Hole Lady"

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:56.458
Not bad at all.

00:03:56.458 --> 00:03:57.625
But!

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:07.458
You need to know more than
just forms if you wanna win.

00:04:07.458 --> 00:04:09.292
Once more, please!

00:04:09.292 --> 00:04:11.125
Give it up already!

00:04:11.125 --> 00:04:12.833
Please!

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:18.542
You won't get anywhere if you
let your emotions carry you away.

00:04:23.208 --> 00:04:25.625
"Let's all take care of our parks!"

00:04:25.625 --> 00:04:28.292
There were some last night too, huh?

00:04:28.292 --> 00:04:31.042
There have been a lot of incidents lately.

00:04:31.042 --> 00:04:34.292
I get the feeling it's not all demons though.

00:04:34.292 --> 00:04:35.833
You're exactly right.

00:04:35.833 --> 00:04:39.292
There've been more and more
copycat crimes done to look like demons.

00:04:39.292 --> 00:04:43.250
At this point, it's hard to tell which ones are fake.

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:47.875
People are dyin'.
There's nothing fake about that.

00:04:49.958 --> 00:04:51.375
Sorry...

00:04:51.375 --> 00:04:54.375
But why?

00:04:54.375 --> 00:04:57.750
Guess it means there's no friggin'
difference between people and demons.

00:04:59.667 --> 00:05:01.875
So, what do you know?

00:05:04.708 --> 00:05:07.958
This one's been going
after athletic club members.

00:05:07.958 --> 00:05:10.042
It kinda smells like the work
of demons to me, doesn't it?

00:05:10.042 --> 00:05:10.667
"Bizarre Murder in Kabukicho"

00:05:10.667 --> 00:05:13.625
"Bizarre Murder in Kabukicho"
The news has been saying "part of the body",

00:05:13.625 --> 00:05:16.292
but it's the arms they're going for,
the right arm to be exact.

00:05:16.292 --> 00:05:17.750
What the heck...

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:19.667
What does Kisaragi say?

00:05:19.667 --> 00:05:21.417
Nothing, really.

00:05:25.167 --> 00:05:27.417
But look at how hard
you guys have been working,

00:05:27.417 --> 00:05:29.292
even doing this special training and all!

00:05:29.292 --> 00:05:33.125
And Misato even busted out
a <i>naginata</i>! That's unexpected!

00:05:33.125 --> 00:05:37.250
Well, without any strength,
I can't protect what's dear to me.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:40.625
Yeah, that's right. Hey, we all
made up our minds to do this.

00:05:40.625 --> 00:05:43.208
Yeah, and that's how it is!

00:05:54.375 --> 00:05:55.958
This will do.

00:06:03.167 --> 00:06:05.417
Give the sea lice over for analysis.

00:06:05.417 --> 00:06:08.083
It's possible it's the same culprit
behind both the Ihara parasite incident

00:06:08.083 --> 00:06:10.000
and what happened in Nozawa.

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:11.792
The barnacle incident in Kozuka

00:06:11.792 --> 00:06:14.792
bears a resemblance to
the incident over in Iwata the other day.

00:06:14.792 --> 00:06:18.042
The killing of the man in
Miya Park seems to be a copycat

00:06:18.042 --> 00:06:20.958
patterned after that unusual string of murders.

00:06:20.958 --> 00:06:23.708
We've got the man who did it in custody.

00:06:26.042 --> 00:06:27.708
Hey, it's me.

00:06:27.708 --> 00:06:29.958
About that high schooler from the other day...

00:06:29.958 --> 00:06:31.458
The one with the holes?

00:06:31.458 --> 00:06:35.333
Yeah, like I thought,
they're beehive holes all right.

00:06:35.333 --> 00:06:39.125
And just like before,
the right arm is completely gone.

00:06:39.125 --> 00:06:41.333
No matter how ya look at it, this is...

00:06:51.458 --> 00:06:53.333
Hey, I said I'm sorry!

00:06:53.333 --> 00:06:55.500
I didn't think I'd actually hit you!

00:06:57.958 --> 00:06:59.958
Oh, boy...

00:06:59.958 --> 00:07:01.958
What's that, Hiyu?

00:07:01.958 --> 00:07:03.542
Long underwear!

00:07:03.542 --> 00:07:05.333
Underwear?

00:07:05.333 --> 00:07:08.833
You mean from back then?

00:07:08.833 --> 00:07:11.750
You weren't making that up to fool her?

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:14.292
Right, after all, it'll be getting cold before long.

00:07:14.292 --> 00:07:16.167
And how old are you?

00:07:16.167 --> 00:07:19.833
This shatters the image of
the mysterious transfer student!

00:07:19.833 --> 00:07:22.458
They're not for me.
I was planning to send them to my dad.

00:07:22.458 --> 00:07:24.417
Okay, I'd hope so.

00:07:24.417 --> 00:07:26.875
"Send" them to him?
Is he living away from your family?

00:07:26.875 --> 00:07:29.292
No, I am.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:32.792
I'm living in Tokyo on my own.

00:07:32.792 --> 00:07:35.583
Really? A new truth uncovered!

00:07:35.583 --> 00:07:39.167
The mysterious transfer
student is living on his own?!

00:07:39.167 --> 00:07:43.417
Lucky him, getting to live alone.
Sounds like it must be fun.

00:07:43.417 --> 00:07:46.167
Your parents couldn't come with you?

00:07:46.167 --> 00:07:48.625
Well, at their age it wouldn't be so easy.

00:07:48.625 --> 00:07:50.958
Are they that old?

00:07:50.958 --> 00:07:52.625
But you live apart from them?

00:07:52.625 --> 00:07:56.458
And not simply apart, but as
a high schooler alone in Tokyo!

00:07:56.458 --> 00:08:01.333
Wow... So why? What could be the reason?

00:08:01.333 --> 00:08:04.833
Enough about that.
Let's go get some ramen, man.

00:08:04.833 --> 00:08:08.000
Well, I've got club practice, so I'll catch you later.

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:11.542
Oh, right. You've got that
tournament coming up, right?

00:08:11.542 --> 00:08:14.250
Yeah, and it's my last one
in my high school career.

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:16.042
Means I gotta go all-out.

00:08:16.042 --> 00:08:18.083
You'll come watch, right, Aoi?

00:08:18.083 --> 00:08:20.583
Uh, yeah, sure!

00:08:20.583 --> 00:08:24.292
Um... I'll come cheer you on too.

00:08:24.292 --> 00:08:25.500
Thanks, guys!

00:08:26.125 --> 00:08:28.917
How about you stop fussing over
this Kisaragi descendant or whoever,

00:08:28.917 --> 00:08:30.750
and go for something bigger?

00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:33.333
It's your fault my plan went awry.

00:08:33.333 --> 00:08:34.667
Do you understand?

00:08:34.667 --> 00:08:36.167
Oh, shut up...

00:08:36.167 --> 00:08:38.583
And the seeds have been sown, haven't they?

00:08:38.583 --> 00:08:43.792
The amount of progress we've made
won't be satisfactory to him though.

00:08:45.583 --> 00:08:47.250
What's with you?!

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:51.458
Oh, nothing. I couldn't care less about him.

00:08:51.458 --> 00:08:54.792
I just do as I please, that's all.

00:08:56.708 --> 00:08:58.458
Where the heck are they?

00:08:58.458 --> 00:09:03.583
The Dragon Stream has certainly
activated their powers sufficiently.

00:09:03.583 --> 00:09:06.583
They should have appeared by now.

00:09:06.583 --> 00:09:10.125
And that one bothers me.

00:09:11.125 --> 00:09:11.667
"New Century Shopping Center"

00:09:11.667 --> 00:09:14.833
This is supposedly an effect of gelidium jelly.

00:09:14.833 --> 00:09:16.667
Now for our next story...

00:09:16.667 --> 00:09:19.792
Police say they have identified
the body found on the roadside

00:09:19.792 --> 00:09:25.000
in Nakamura in Nerima Ward
during the early morning of the 20th.

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:27.875
The victim was 20-year-old Eita Ikeda.

00:09:37.625 --> 00:09:40.875
--So, where do you want to go?
--Same place as always, of course.

00:09:40.875 --> 00:09:42.667
Say, Kyouichi, what's strawberry ramen?

00:09:42.667 --> 00:09:43.458
Huh?

00:09:43.458 --> 00:09:46.417
You... You there!

00:09:47.417 --> 00:09:50.667
I sense very powerful light emanating from you.

00:09:50.667 --> 00:09:53.917
It is mighty and illuminates all.

00:09:53.917 --> 00:09:55.917
Master Ryuzan!

00:09:55.917 --> 00:09:58.375
It has been some time, Daigo.

00:09:58.375 --> 00:10:01.125
You're looking good. When did you return?

00:10:01.125 --> 00:10:02.833
Just the other day.

00:10:02.833 --> 00:10:06.625
This shady-looking guy is your teacher?

00:10:06.625 --> 00:10:09.125
Don't you be rude to him!

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:14.000
It's quite all right. My name is Ryuzan Arai.

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:16.750
And you are Daigo's friend, I take it?

00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:18.750
Friend?

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:23.250
He and I go to the same school;
his name is Houraiji. And that is Hiyu.

00:10:27.792 --> 00:10:31.417
You have a nice face, young man.

00:10:34.958 --> 00:10:39.708
Daigo, has time begun to flow inside you?

00:10:53.833 --> 00:10:56.625
A nasty affair...

00:10:56.625 --> 00:10:59.792
They say the bodies were completely desiccated.

00:10:59.792 --> 00:11:05.875
As disturbing as we find it,
lately it's been nothing but cases like this.

00:11:05.875 --> 00:11:09.042
And what are the police doing?

00:11:09.042 --> 00:11:11.833
Well, even if they do
capture whoever's behind it,

00:11:11.833 --> 00:11:15.250
that's not about to bring
back the dead now, is it?

00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:17.125
Cripes...

00:11:17.125 --> 00:11:22.625
It's just unbearable to think of
the bereaved families, y'know?

00:11:22.625 --> 00:11:24.875
Ex-Excuse me.

00:11:35.292 --> 00:11:38.625
Not it! This isn't it!

00:11:38.625 --> 00:11:40.875
This isn't the arm either.

00:12:01.792 --> 00:12:05.375
Komaki Sakurai?

00:12:05.375 --> 00:12:08.250
Komaki Sakurai!

00:12:16.792 --> 00:12:22.458
The Kozunu clan--they summon
demons, disturb the Dragon Stream,

00:12:22.458 --> 00:12:24.292
and beyond that...

00:12:25.458 --> 00:12:27.958
The Eight-Hands-Breadth Sword...

00:12:27.958 --> 00:12:32.000
With that and the disturbances
in the Dragon Stream...

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:34.958
It couldn't be! The Bodhisattva Eye?!

00:12:38.125 --> 00:12:41.458
Um... You made this all yourself?

00:12:41.458 --> 00:12:45.250
Yes! I spent nine hours since
early this morning preparing it all.

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:46.250
This is great!

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:48.708
Hey, get your damn hands off!

00:12:51.458 --> 00:12:53.167
You two...

00:12:53.167 --> 00:12:55.167
Don't be so stingy!

00:12:56.208 --> 00:13:00.208
I don't know if Sakurai will like it though.

00:13:01.792 --> 00:13:04.958
Mmm... It's better than I expected!

00:13:04.958 --> 00:13:08.458
Hey hubby, lunches made by
the wife are always the best, right?

00:13:08.458 --> 00:13:10.583
What the hell, Kyouichi?!

00:13:10.583 --> 00:13:13.917
Well, now that looks good!

00:13:13.917 --> 00:13:16.750
Long time, no see, Komaki!

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:18.333
Are you doing all right?

00:13:18.333 --> 00:13:21.125
Long time, no see, you two!

00:13:21.125 --> 00:13:23.667
I knew I'd be sure to see you guys today!

00:13:23.667 --> 00:13:27.458
Let's all do our best, Lady Komaki.

00:13:27.458 --> 00:13:28.792
Who are they?

00:13:28.792 --> 00:13:31.125
They're from the Yukimigahara
High School archery team.

00:13:31.125 --> 00:13:35.583
Hinano Oribe and her <i>naginata</i>
expert older sister, Yukino.

00:13:35.583 --> 00:13:38.458
Hinano and Sakurai are long-time rivals,

00:13:38.458 --> 00:13:42.167
and their duels are always
the main attraction at these tournaments.

00:13:42.167 --> 00:13:44.708
Plus, the Oribe sisters are
as smart as they are pretty,

00:13:44.708 --> 00:13:46.625
and they're popular even at our school!

00:13:46.625 --> 00:13:49.250
It'd be a total waste not to do an article on them!

00:13:49.250 --> 00:13:51.417
How about that...

00:13:51.417 --> 00:13:53.000
Who cares?

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:54.625
You want some too?

00:13:54.625 --> 00:13:59.750
Thanks, but I've got other stories
to cover today, so I've gotta run.

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:01.375
Ah, I see.

00:14:01.375 --> 00:14:04.750
Hey, you two have some of this! It's damn good!

00:14:07.958 --> 00:14:09.167
What?

00:14:09.167 --> 00:14:11.292
Don't scare Hina!

00:14:11.292 --> 00:14:12.458
Let's go.

00:14:14.708 --> 00:14:16.667
Komaki number two.

00:14:30.792 --> 00:14:32.958
Komaki...

00:14:32.958 --> 00:14:38.042
No... No... No, no...

00:14:38.042 --> 00:14:42.083
No, no, no, no!

00:14:42.083 --> 00:14:45.208
No... No...

00:14:45.208 --> 00:14:48.625
Komaki Sakurai!

00:15:01.708 --> 00:15:06.917
It's just unbearable to think of
the bereaved families, y'know?

00:15:11.417 --> 00:15:13.083
"Tenth Annual Governor's Cup
High School Division"

00:15:13.083 --> 00:15:14.333
Who's that?

00:15:14.333 --> 00:15:16.958
Huh? Oh, jeez...

00:15:16.958 --> 00:15:19.750
Hey, there's a sign over there.

00:15:19.750 --> 00:15:23.042
We can't admit anyone who's
not involved with the tournament.

00:15:49.708 --> 00:15:50.792
This is...

00:15:50.792 --> 00:15:53.167
The bastards come out whenever
and wherever the hell they want to!

00:15:55.958 --> 00:15:57.458
I will protect them!

00:16:05.292 --> 00:16:06.792
You'll give it to me, right?

00:16:06.792 --> 00:16:13.000
Sakurai, you're so nice.
You'll give it to me, won't you?

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:16.833
That arm!

00:16:27.417 --> 00:16:28.417
Komaki!

00:16:28.417 --> 00:16:29.625
Aoi!

00:16:31.042 --> 00:16:32.750
Komaki!

00:16:37.125 --> 00:16:39.958
--Let go!
--My arm's broken.

00:16:39.958 --> 00:16:43.792
--Damn it, let go!
--Give me this one!

00:16:43.792 --> 00:16:45.875
Komaki!

00:16:45.875 --> 00:16:48.167
Stop it! Let go of Komaki!

00:16:49.083 --> 00:16:50.208
Aoi!

00:17:00.458 --> 00:17:05.000
Aoi! Aoi! You're bleeding...

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:07.542
Don't worry about me. Help that person!

00:17:07.542 --> 00:17:10.125
I told you not to let your
emotions run away with you!

00:17:10.125 --> 00:17:11.458
But!

00:17:11.458 --> 00:17:13.917
Just stay there for now!

00:17:13.917 --> 00:17:17.208
--Houraiji!
--Aoi, calm down! Aoi!

00:17:17.208 --> 00:17:18.375
I know!

00:17:38.042 --> 00:17:39.125
Tatsuma!

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:44.042
I'll be fine!

00:17:45.917 --> 00:17:48.625
Who are you?!

00:17:50.083 --> 00:17:53.625
Who the hell are you?!

00:17:53.625 --> 00:17:56.000
--Let go, Komaki!
--Aoi, what's wrong?!

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:57.458
I want to protect them!

00:17:57.458 --> 00:18:00.542
I don't... I don't want anyone else to...

00:18:12.458 --> 00:18:17.958
C'mon, leggo! I hate pushy women!

00:18:23.292 --> 00:18:24.458
Daigo!

00:18:27.625 --> 00:18:29.292
I get it.

00:18:36.083 --> 00:18:37.917
Whoa, hey!

00:19:01.417 --> 00:19:03.708
Now you can't fly, can you?

00:19:03.708 --> 00:19:06.083
Get ready to die.

00:19:06.083 --> 00:19:07.458
Don't!

00:19:09.458 --> 00:19:13.000
Who are you? Who the hell are you?

00:19:32.375 --> 00:19:33.833
Thank goodness...

00:19:33.833 --> 00:19:37.458
Again... I've been made
a fool of by Komaki Sakurai again.

00:19:37.458 --> 00:19:40.083
She acts so innocent,
even though she's really got power,

00:19:40.083 --> 00:19:42.000
and then crushes me yet again.

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:44.417
Nothing has changed since back then.

00:19:44.417 --> 00:19:47.875
What are you talking about?
You act like you know me.

00:19:47.875 --> 00:19:51.042
Huh? You don't remember?

00:19:56.917 --> 00:19:58.417
What?!

00:19:58.417 --> 00:20:00.667
She says she doesn't remember!

00:20:04.667 --> 00:20:05.958
Watch out, Aoi.

00:20:05.958 --> 00:20:07.625
It's all right.

00:20:07.625 --> 00:20:12.917
I don't know what you've been through.

00:20:12.917 --> 00:20:16.583
But it won't help anything
if you keep on doing this.

00:20:16.583 --> 00:20:19.917
Please, stop killing people!

00:20:19.917 --> 00:20:23.250
Why can't you just become friends with Komaki?

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:25.958
I'll do whatever I can for you!

00:20:25.958 --> 00:20:28.083
So please... Please!

00:20:30.417 --> 00:20:31.875
Please...

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:36.875
Give it back.

00:20:36.875 --> 00:20:39.583
Give me my arm back.

00:20:39.583 --> 00:20:42.500
Give it back! Give it back!

00:20:56.250 --> 00:20:59.417
If I ever lost the ability to draw my bow...

00:21:10.125 --> 00:21:11.500
No!

00:21:33.167 --> 00:21:34.792
Sakuya...

00:21:36.750 --> 00:21:38.250
Sakurai!

00:21:40.667 --> 00:21:46.958
I can't protect them.
I couldn't protect her. I... I...

00:21:54.708 --> 00:21:57.458
"Seventh Annual Governor's Cup
Middle School Division"

00:22:05.208 --> 00:22:09.125
We've practiced hard for this.

00:22:09.125 --> 00:22:11.375
So, let's both give it our all!

00:22:11.375 --> 00:22:13.625
Okay!

00:22:13.625 --> 00:22:16.292
So that we don't have any regrets.

00:22:18.458 --> 00:22:21.750
If I ever lost the ability to draw my bow...

00:22:21.750 --> 00:22:24.250
...I might as well die!

00:22:24.250 --> 00:22:26.000
